arithmetic with circuits
************************

There are many arithmetic operations that can be performed on *note gates:
Gate,. This makes it easy to create combine existing gates into new gates.

+------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : declareVariable X; declareVariable Y;      |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : m1 = Y*Y                                   |
|                                                |
|o3 = (Y * Y)                                    |
|                                                |
|o3 : ProductGate                                |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : m2 = X^3                                   |
|                                                |
|o4 = (X * X * X)                                |
|                                                |
|o4 : ProductGate                                |
+------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : F = m1-m2-X                                |
|                                                |
|o5 = (((Y * Y) + (-1 * (X * X * X))) + (-1 * X))|
|                                                |
|o5 : SumGate                                    |
+------------------------------------------------+

If one of the inputs is a *note Number: (Macaulay2Doc)Number,, it is first
converted to an *note InputGate: Gate,:

+------------+
|i6 : X + 2  |
|            |
|o6 = (X + 2)|
|            |
|o6 : SumGate|
+------------+

By extension, arithmetic operations also work with *note gate matrices:
GateMatrix,:

+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : M = matrix {{X, Y}}                             |
|                                                     |
|o7 = {{X, Y}}                                        |
|                                                     |
|o7 : GateMatrix                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : 3*M                                             |
|                                                     |
|o8 = {{(3 * X), (3 * Y)}}                            |
|                                                     |
|o8 : GateMatrix                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------+
|i9 : transpose M * M                                 |
|                                                     |
|o9 = {{((X * X)), ((X * Y))}, {((Y * X)), ((Y * Y))}}|
|                                                     |
|o9 : GateMatrix                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------+

