creating gates
**************

  * Usage: 
        inputGate L
        sumGate L
        productGate L
  * Inputs:
      * L, a *note list: (Macaulay2Doc)List,, 
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note InputGate: Gate,, 

This method returns a type of *note Gate: Gate, from the given data. Some
specific *note Gate: Gate,s are constructed as follows:

*note InputGate: Gate, is constructed with *note inputGate: creating gates,
name, if name is a number then this gate is assumed to be constant.

+----------------------+
|i1 : declareVariable X|
|                      |
|o1 = X                |
|                      |
|o1 : InputGate        |
+----------------------+
|i2 : declareVariable Y|
|                      |
|o2 = Y                |
|                      |
|o2 : InputGate        |
+----------------------+
|i3 : inputGate 3      |
|                      |
|o3 = 3                |
|                      |
|o3 : InputGate        |
+----------------------+

*note SumGate: Gate, is constructed with *note sumGate: creating gates, L,
where L is a list of gates, or *note Gate + Gate: arithmetic with circuits,.

+-----------------+
|i4 : X + 1       |
|                 |
|o4 = (X + 1)     |
|                 |
|o4 : SumGate     |
+-----------------+
|i5 : sumGate{X,Y}|
|                 |
|o5 = (X + Y)     |
|                 |
|o5 : SumGate     |
+-----------------+

*note ProductGate: Gate, is constructed with *note productGate: creating gates,
L, where L is a list of gates, or *note Gate * Gate: arithmetic with circuits,.

+------------------------+
|i6 : 2*Y                |
|                        |
|o6 = (2 * Y)            |
|                        |
|o6 : ProductGate        |
+------------------------+
|i7 : productGate{X,-X,Y}|
|                        |
|o7 = (X * (-1 * X) * Y) |
|                        |
|o7 : ProductGate        |
+------------------------+

*note DivideGate: Gate, is constructed with *note Gate / Gate: arithmetic with
circuits,.

+---------------+
|i8 : X / Y     |
|               |
|     X         |
|o8 = -         |
|     Y         |
|               |
|o8 : DivideGate|
+---------------+

*note DetGate: Gate, is constructed with *note detGate: creating gates, L,
where L is a doubly-nested list of gates, or det A, where A is a *note
GateMatrix: GateMatrix,.

+---------------------------------+
|i9 : detGate {{X, Y}, {-Y, X}}   |
|                                 |
|o9 = det| X        Y |           |
|        | (-1 * Y) X |           |
|                                 |
|o9 : DetGate                     |
+---------------------------------+
|i10 : det matrix{{Y, 1}, {-1, X}}|
|                                 |
|o10 = det| Y  1 |                |
|         | -1 X |                |
|                                 |
|o10 : DetGate                    |
+---------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note Gate: Gate, -- the class of all gates
