gateMatrix -- create a GateMatrix
*********************************

  * Usage: 
        gateMatrix M
  * Inputs:
      * M, a *note matrix: (Macaulay2Doc)matrix, or a table (a nested *note
        List: (Macaulay2Doc)List,)
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note GateMatrix: GateMatrix,, 

Description
===========

This methods creates a *note GateMatrix: GateMatrix, from the given input data,
which should be a matrix or a doubly-nested list.

The package *note SLPexpressions: Top, overrides *note matrix:
(Macaulay2Doc)matrix, to allow a table (a nested list) of *note Gate: Gate,s as
an argument.



+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : declareVariable x; declareVariable y;                                   |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : A = matrix { apply(5,i->i*x) }                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o3 = {{0, x, (2 * x), (3 * x), (4 * x)}}                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : GateMatrix                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i4 : A#0                                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o4 = {0, x, (2 * x), (3 * x), (4 * x)}                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o4 : List                                                                    |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i5 : A#0#0                                                                   |
|                                                                             |
|o5 = 0                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o5 : InputGate                                                               |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i6 : B = matrix { apply(4,i->y^i) }                                          |
|                                                                             |
|o6 = {{1, (y), (y * y), (y * y * y)}}                                        |
|                                                                             |
|o6 : GateMatrix                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i7 : C = transpose A * B                                                     |
|                                                                             |
|o7 = {{(0), (0), (0), (0)}, {(x), ((x * (y))), ((x * (y * y))), ((x * (y * y |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     * y)))}, {((2 * x)), (((2 * x) * (y))), (((2 * x) * (y * y))), (((2 * x)|
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     * (y * y * y)))}, {((3 * x)), (((3 * x) * (y))), (((3 * x) * (y * y))), |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     (((3 * x) * (y * y * y)))}, {((4 * x)), (((4 * x) * (y))), (((4 * x) *  |
|     ------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|     (y * y))), (((4 * x) * (y * y * y)))}}                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o7 : GateMatrix                                                              |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i8 : numrows C, numcols C                                                    |
|                                                                             |
|o8 = (5, 4)                                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o8 : Sequence                                                                |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

See also
========

  * *note GateMatrix: GateMatrix, -- a matrix of Gates

