gatePolynomial -- creates an input gate for a given polynomial
**************************************************************

  * Usage: 
        gatePolynomial f
  * Inputs:
      * f, a *note ring element: (Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,, 
  * Outputs:
      * an instance of the type *note Gate: Gate,, representing the polynomial
        $f$

Description
===========

This methods creates a *note Gate: Gate, from the given input polynomial $f$.
The resulting *note Gate: Gate, is a *note SumGate: Gate, whose terms are *note
product gates: Gate, corresponding to monomials of $f$.

+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i1 : R = QQ[x,y]                                                             |
|                                                                             |
|o1 = R                                                                       |
|                                                                             |
|o1 : PolynomialRing                                                          |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i2 : f = random(3, R)                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|     9 3   9 2    3   2   7 3                                                |
|o2 = -x  + -x y + -x*y  + -y                                                 |
|     2     4      4       4                                                  |
|                                                                             |
|o2 : R                                                                       |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|i3 : gatePolynomial f                                                        |
|                                                                             |
|       9                         9                             3             |
|o3 = ((- * ([x] * [x] * [x])) + (- * (([x] * [x]) * ([y]))) + (- * (([x]) *  |
|       2                         4                             4             |
|                                                                             |
|o3 : SumGate                                                                 |
|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|                 7                                                           |
|([y] * [y]))) + (- * ([y] * [y] * [y])))                                     |
|                 4                                                           |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------+

