isConstant(InputGate) -- whether an input gate is constant
**********************************************************

  * Function: *note isConstant: (Macaulay2Doc)isConstant,
  * Usage: 
        isConstant g
  * Inputs:
      * g, an instance of the type *note InputGate: Gate,, 
  * Outputs:
      * a *note Boolean value: (Macaulay2Doc)Boolean,, whether g is a constant

Description
===========

An input gate is constant if its *note Name: (Macaulay2Doc)newPackage, is
either a *note Number: (Macaulay2Doc)Number, or a *note RingElement:
(Macaulay2Doc)RingElement,.

+----------------------+
|i1 : declareVariable X|
|                      |
|o1 = X                |
|                      |
|o1 : InputGate        |
+----------------------+
|i2 : isConstant X     |
|                      |
|o2 = false            |
+----------------------+
|i3 : isConstant 3     |
|                      |
|o3 = true             |
+----------------------+

